# Apex Digital Solutions LLC — Bootstrap
# Run from T1-Bootstrap/ directory
# Prerequisite: PE backend running, regulation packages imported

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PREREQUISITE: Regulation packages (one-time, per PE instance)
# Run Setup.Regulation.pecmd from the US.Payroll distribution package:
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.Federal.Tax.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.Federal.FICA.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.State.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.State.Withholding.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.State.MultiState.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.State.WageBase.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.Local.Tax.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.Local.Tax.WageBase.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.Local.Tax.IndianaCounty.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.Local.Tax.Philadelphia.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.Local.Tax.NewYork.2026.json
#   PayrollImport <path>/US.Payroll.Data.Federal.Garnishment.2026.json
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Step 0: Clean slate — remove any prior demo tenant (safe to run on a fresh DB)
TenantDelete Apex.DigitalSolutions /trydelete

# Step 1: Tenant structure
# Creates: tenant Apex.DigitalSolutions, admin user, Apex.Division,
#          10 employees, 3 payrolls (Monthly/Biweekly/Weekly), 3 payruns
PayrollImport Setup.json

# Step 2: Company cases — pay frequency per payroll
# Monthly (annualization factor 12), Biweekly (26), Weekly (52)
PayrollImport CompanyCases/Monthly.json
PayrollImport CompanyCases/Biweekly.json
PayrollImport CompanyCases/Weekly.json

# Step 3: Employee cases
# Monthly payroll employees
PayrollImport Employees/01-SaraChen.json
PayrollImport Employees/02-RobertStevenson.json

# Biweekly payroll employees
PayrollImport Employees/03-MarcusJohnson.json
PayrollImport Employees/04-PriyaPatel.json
PayrollImport Employees/05-KevinWu.json
PayrollImport Employees/06-JessicaTorres.json
PayrollImport Employees/07-CarlosRivera.json
PayrollImport Employees/08-LindaOkafor.json

# Weekly payroll employees
PayrollImport Employees/09-DavidKim.json
PayrollImport Employees/10-AshleyPark.json
